# Copied into dist/ by Vite. Applied to static-asset responses only.
# CSP is intentionally omitted: WebGL, LiveKit, Supabase, and OAuth popups
# need a long allowlist that would break the app if guessed. Tighten later
# with a measured policy. COOP is same-origin-allow-popups so the OAuth
# popup can still postMessage to window.opener (see docs/security.md).

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(self)
